SettingsCenter.AltNumberSwitchesTabs.Description=Reserve Alt+number shortcuts for workspace selection.
SettingsCenter.AltNumberSwitchesTabs.Label=Alt+number switches tabs
SettingsCenter.AlwaysShowMenuBar.Description=Keep the main menu bar visible instead of showing it only when activated.
SettingsCenter.AlwaysShowMenuBar.Label=Always show menu bar
SettingsCenter.Apply=&Apply
SettingsCenter.ApplyCommandParallelism.Description=Maximum concurrent commands in Apply command. Zero means unlimited. The initial default is the logical CPU count.
SettingsCenter.ApplyCommandParallelism.Label=Concurrent Apply commands
SettingsCenter.AutoSaveCurrentPanel.Description=Remember locations and focused files for both sides of saved workspaces. Save and restore panel paths must also be enabled.
SettingsCenter.AutoSaveCurrentPanel.Label=Save panel locations automatically
SettingsCenter.AutoSaveDialogSettings.Description=Automatically persist configuration and dialog-related changes. Explicit Apply still saves when this is off.
SettingsCenter.AutoSaveDialogSettings.Label=Save preferences automatically
SettingsCenter.AutoSaveGUIWindow.Description=Remember supported graphical-window dimensions and position, not external terminal geometry.
SettingsCenter.AutoSaveGUIWindow.Label=Save graphical window automatically
SettingsCenter.AutoSavePanelSettings.Description=Remember panel view modes, sorting, visibility, active workspace and workspace layout.
SettingsCenter.AutoSavePanelSettings.Label=Save panel layout automatically
