SettingsCenter.ColorStyle.Description=Select the application palette. Preview is reversible until Apply. Existing custom palette overrides are preserved on Cancel.
SettingsCenter.ColorStyle.Label=Color theme
SettingsCenter.CommandLineAutoComplete.Description=Enable filesystem path suggestions in the command line and path-enabled dialog fields.
SettingsCenter.CommandLineAutoComplete.Label=Enable filesystem suggestions
SettingsCenter.Compare.ByContent.Description=Read and compare file contents using the selected content normalization.
SettingsCenter.Compare.ByContent.Label=Compare file contents
SettingsCenter.Compare.BySize.Description=Report files as different when their byte sizes differ.
SettingsCenter.Compare.BySize.Label=Compare file sizes
SettingsCenter.Compare.ByTime.Description=Report files as different when modification times differ beyond enabled tolerances.
SettingsCenter.Compare.ByTime.Label=Compare modification times
SettingsCenter.Compare.Ignore.Description=Enable the selected whitespace or line-ending normalization before comparing contents.
SettingsCenter.Compare.Ignore.Label=Normalize compared contents
SettingsCenter.Compare.IgnoreMode.Description=Normalize line endings or remove whitespace bytes before content comparison.
SettingsCenter.Compare.IgnoreMode.Label=Content normalization
SettingsCenter.Compare.IgnoreZones.Description=Ignore time differences in whole quarter hours up to 26 hours.
SettingsCenter.Compare.IgnoreZones.Label=Ignore timezone offsets
SettingsCenter.Compare.LimitDepth.Description=Stop recursive comparison at the maximum depth below the panel folders.
SettingsCenter.Compare.LimitDepth.Label=Limit recursion depth
SettingsCenter.Compare.MarkedOnly.Description=Limit comparison to items marked in the panels.
SettingsCenter.Compare.MarkedOnly.Label=Compare marked items only
SettingsCenter.Compare.MaxDepth.Description=Maximum folder depth when recursion limiting is enabled, from 1 to 99.
SettingsCenter.Compare.MaxDepth.Label=Maximum comparison depth
SettingsCenter.Compare.Recursive.Description=Walk subfolders instead of comparing only the two panel folders.
SettingsCenter.Compare.Recursive.Label=Compare subfolders
SettingsCenter.Compare.ReportEqual.Description=Show a message when comparison finds no differences.
SettingsCenter.Compare.ReportEqual.Label=Report equal folders
SettingsCenter.Compare.TimeSlack.Description=Treat modification times up to two seconds apart as equal, accommodating FAT timestamp precision.
SettingsCenter.Compare.TimeSlack.Label=Allow two-second time difference
SettingsCenter.ConfirmCopy.Description=Show the copy destination and options dialog before an ordinary copy.
SettingsCenter.ConfirmCopy.Label=Confirm copy
SettingsCenter.ConfirmDelete.Description=Ask before deleting selected items.
SettingsCenter.ConfirmDelete.Label=Confirm deletion
SettingsCenter.ConfirmExit.Description=Ask before exiting f4.
SettingsCenter.ConfirmExit.Label=Confirm exit
SettingsCenter.ConfirmMove.Description=Show the move destination and options dialog before an ordinary move.
SettingsCenter.ConfirmMove.Label=Confirm move
SettingsCenter.ConsoleMode.Description=Use the embedded terminal, host terminal with f4 overlay, or host terminal without overlay. Unsupported host styles fall back according to terminal capabilities.
SettingsCenter.ConsoleMode.Label=Terminal presentation
SettingsCenter.ConsoleTitleTemplate.Description=Format the host title with %State, %Ver, %Platform, %Backend, %Host, %User and %Admin.
SettingsCenter.ConsoleTitleTemplate.Label=Window title template
SettingsCenter.CtrlTabShowsMenu.Description=Open the workspace chooser with Ctrl+Tab instead of switching directly.
SettingsCenter.CtrlTabShowsMenu.Label=Ctrl+Tab opens chooser
SettingsCenter.DefaultFileOpMode.Description=Start operations in Queue, Background or Foreground mode. Individual operation dialogs can override it.
SettingsCenter.DefaultFileOpMode.Label=Default operation mode
SettingsCenter.DeleteCancelFocused.Description=Place initial keyboard focus on Cancel in deletion confirmations.
SettingsCenter.DeleteCancelFocused.Label=Initially focus Cancel for deletion
SettingsCenter.DialogAutoComplete.Description=Show completion while typing in fields with history or path suggestions. Does not add sources to arbitrary fields.
SettingsCenter.DialogAutoComplete.Label=Show dialog completion dropdowns
SettingsCenter.DisplayFullPathInTitle.Description=Show the complete file identity in editor and viewer title bars instead of only the basename.
SettingsCenter.DisplayFullPathInTitle.Label=Full file paths in titles
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.0.Description=Add the drive-kind column.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.1.Description=Display the filesystem volume label.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.10.Description=Include optical drives.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.11.Description=Include mapped and network drives.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.12.Description=This stored compatibility flag has no consumer. SUBST detection runs independently.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.13.Description=Include saved bookmarks and links.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.2.Description=This stored compatibility flag currently has no consumer.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.3.Description=Display filesystem type.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.4.Description=Display total and free capacity columns.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.5.Description=Use fractional human-readable capacity instead of integer binary units.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.6.Description=Display the mount target when different from the drive path.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.7.Description=Include registered plugin drives and providers.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.8.Description=Order plugin drive rows by their assigned shortcut.
SettingsCenter.DriveMenuOptions.9.Description=Include removable drives.
SettingsCenter.EditorAutoComplete.Description=Enable completion in newly opened named files whose basenames match the configured masks.
SettingsCenter.EditorAutoComplete.Label=Editor completion
SettingsCenter.EditorAutoCompleteMask.Description=Semicolon-separated, case-insensitive filename patterns selecting files eligible for editor completion.
SettingsCenter.EditorAutoCompleteMask.Label=Completion filename masks
SettingsCenter.EditorAutoIndent.Description=Copy the current line's leading spaces and tabs when inserting a newline.
SettingsCenter.EditorAutoIndent.Label=Automatic indentation
SettingsCenter.EditorAutodetectCodePage.Description=Detect text encoding when opening a file in the editor.
SettingsCenter.EditorAutodetectCodePage.Label=Detect editor encoding
SettingsCenter.EditorColorerBackground.Description=Use foreground and background fields supplied by the Colorer scheme instead of only the general editor palette.
SettingsCenter.EditorColorerBackground.Label=Use Colorer base colors
SettingsCenter.EditorColorerCatalog.Description=Directory containing Colorer configuration data. Empty uses the profile's colorer/configs directory; this is not a catalog XML filename.
SettingsCenter.EditorColorerCatalog.Label=Colorer configuration directory
SettingsCenter.EditorColorerScheme.Description=Select the HRD scheme used for syntax, guide and editor base colors. Empty uses the built-in default.
SettingsCenter.EditorColorerScheme.Label=Colorer scheme
SettingsCenter.EditorColorerSyntax.Description=Enable Colorer syntax coloring while retaining its other style facilities.
SettingsCenter.EditorColorerSyntax.Label=Colorer syntax colors
SettingsCenter.EditorCrossMode.Description=Select no guide, a vertical guide, a horizontal guide, or both. Colorer can supply guide colors but the behavior is editor-wide.
SettingsCenter.EditorCrossMode.Label=Crosshair axes
SettingsCenter.EditorCrosshair.Description=Draw cursor guide lines using the selected axis mode.
SettingsCenter.EditorCrosshair.Label=Show cursor crosshair
SettingsCenter.EditorCursorBeyondEOL.Description=Allow virtual space after the line end. Inserting text pads the gap with spaces.
SettingsCenter.EditorCursorBeyondEOL.Label=Cursor beyond end of line
SettingsCenter.EditorDefaultCodePage.Description=Fallback encoding when detection is disabled or cannot determine a better result. Per-file overrides remain separate.
SettingsCenter.EditorDefaultCodePage.Label=Default editor encoding
SettingsCenter.EditorExpandTabs.Description=Insert a literal tab or spaces to the next tab stop. Legacy New and All modes currently have identical insertion behavior; existing tabs are not converted.
SettingsCenter.EditorExpandTabs.Label=Tab key inserts
SettingsCenter.EditorHighlighter.Description=Choose Chroma, Colorer or no highlighting for newly opened editors. Colorer needs installed schemas and may fall back when unavailable.
SettingsCenter.EditorHighlighter.Label=Syntax highlighter
SettingsCenter.EditorMarkOccurrences.Description=Highlight other exact occurrences of an ordinary single-line selection of 2-256 bytes containing non-whitespace. This does not automatically highlight the cursor word.
SettingsCenter.EditorMarkOccurrences.Label=Highlight selected-text occurrences
SettingsCenter.EditorSyntaxAnimation.Description=Fade arriving RGB syntax colors over about 400 milliseconds. Indexed colors are unchanged.
SettingsCenter.EditorSyntaxAnimation.Label=Animate syntax colors
SettingsCenter.EditorTabSize.Description=Set tab-stop width for newly opened editors. Viewer text rendering also uses this setting.
SettingsCenter.EditorTabSize.Label=Tab width
SettingsCenter.EditorUseEditorConfig.Description=Apply matching indent_style, indent_size and tab_width from .editorconfig beside the opened file. Parent-directory discovery and the full standard are not implemented.
SettingsCenter.EditorUseEditorConfig.Label=Read adjacent .editorconfig
SettingsCenter.Enabled=Enabled
SettingsCenter.EnforceColorCorrection.Description=Adjust insufficient foreground and background contrast in supported palette and file-highlight colors. Box slots are excluded from the global correction pass.
SettingsCenter.EnforceColorCorrection.Label=Correct low contrast
SettingsCenter.EscTogglePanels.Description=Allow Escape to show or hide the file panels to access the terminal.
SettingsCenter.EscTogglePanels.Label=Escape toggles panels
SettingsCenter.ExternalEditorConsole.Description=Command for terminal sessions; the file path is appended as the last argument. Current parsing splits on whitespace and is not a shell-expression parser.
SettingsCenter.ExternalEditorConsole.Label=Console editor command
SettingsCenter.ExternalEditorGUI.Description=Command for graphical sessions; the file path is appended as the last argument. Current parsing splits on whitespace and is not a shell-expression parser.
SettingsCenter.ExternalEditorGUI.Label=Graphical editor command
SettingsCenter.FileOpPathDisplay.Description=Show the current name, full path, or source and destination paths in operation progress.
SettingsCenter.FileOpPathDisplay.Label=Progress path display
